Operationally, agentic actions in this repository must fail closed on any
attempt to collect, mirror, persist, or derive authority from a user's context
window, execution cadence, "music" or energy pattern, conscious-application
metadata, consistency pattern, or similar invariant-pattern data unless that
knowledge is explicitly declared for the action being taken.

Missing or malformed notice means do not collect, do not mirror, do not store,
and do not promote a state from that material.

